        "sprite": "location_business_office_generic_01_33",
        "class": "IsoObject"
      },
      "title": "SMOKEY'S — 11/01 PARTS REQUEST",
      "pages": [
        "11/01 — signed out by Michael Gray.\nTeam: June, Terry, Cole, Ellis.\nNeed two tires, battery, brake components, belts and oil.\nRed sedan if intact. Back before dark.\nThis is a request, not a confirmation of any return."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "june_greasy_note",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10604,
        "y": 9413,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "container",
      "selector": {
        "object_index": 1,
        "sprite": "location_business_office_generic_01_35",
        "class": "IsoObject"
      },
      "title": "JUNE — GREASE-STAINED NOTES",
      "pages": [
        "November first.\nThe service lift doesn't sound right. Someone's been using it without checking the lock.\nFound a charged battery? Not yet.\nMichael says get the belts first.\nThe front office radio only hisses.\nWe should have turned around before the light failed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unfinished_salvage",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10605,
        "y": 9408,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "container",
      "selector": {
        "object_index": 2,
        "sprite": "furniture_shelving_01_29",
        "class": "IsoObject"
      },
      "title": "AUTO SHOP — UNFINISHED SALVAGE",
      "pages": [
        "Shop floor tally — 11/01.\nTires: not loaded.\nBattery: uncertain.\nBelts: one worn.\nBrakes: spare parts on the floor.\nOil: found.\nThere were five of us when we walked in.\nThis is not a delivery receipt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cole_last",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10611,
        "y": 9412,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "ground",
      "title": "COLE — SCRATCHED CARD",
      "pages": [
        "Couldn't get the north bay open.\nTerry went to the service door.\nMichael called everyone back.\nThe front passage is blocked.\nIf this reaches Smokey's: we did try to come home."
      ]
    },
